flowchart LR
    TD[Tardis UTC-day files] --> ADMIT[Manifest and quality admission]
    LP[Phase 3 BBO L2 trade Parquet] --> ADMIT
    ADMIT --> CONVERT[Causal Hft event conversion]
    CONVERT --> TYPES[Native BBO clear snapshot trade events]
    TYPES --> NPZ[Deterministic NPZ plus SHA-256 manifest]

    NPZ --> HFT[HftBacktest Rust replay]
    BASE[Baseline scenario] --> HFT
    PESS[Pessimistic scenario] --> HFT
    HFT --> EXEC[Fill fee slippage funding evidence]

    NPZ --> HA[Hft local-arrival adapter]
    NT[Nautilus market-data objects] --> NA[Nautilus adapter]
    HA --> KERNEL[Pure decision kernel]
    NA --> KERNEL
    KERNEL --> PARITY[Exact decision-trace parity]

    NPZ --> WF[Horizon-bound purged walk-forward planner]
    WF --> SELECT[Validation-only selection]
    SELECT --> RECEIPT[Immutable selection receipt]
    RECEIPT --> HOLDOUT[Final holdout access]
    EXEC --> REPORT[Bootstrap and selection-deflated report]
    HOLDOUT --> REPORT
